  "description": "Anglia Ruskin University is located in Cambridge and students really get to experience undergraduate life in this beautiful and iconic university city, less than an hour from London. It was awarded Entrepreneurial University of the Year in the 2014 Times Higher Education Awards and won the Duke of York Award for University Entrepreneurship at the Lloyds Bank National Business Awards in 2016. The Anglia Ruskin College offers undergraduate and postgraduate pathways for students that do not meet the requirements for direct entry, have not studied the subjects required for their chosen degree or spent some time out of education. Following completion of the College pathway students benefit from guaranteed entry into an Anglia Ruskin University degree. Timestamps",
